### What's the maximum audio length? {#whats-the-maximum-audio-length}

The maximum length will depend on the endpoint used, currently the limits are as follows:
- [Chat with Audio](https://docs.mistral.ai/studio/audio/speech_to_text/offline_transcription#chat-with-audio): ≈20 minutes for [Voxtral Mini Transcribe](https://docs.mistral.ai/models/voxtral-mini-transcribe-25-07) and [Voxtral Small](https://docs.mistral.ai/models/voxtral-small-25-07).
- [Transcription](https://docs.mistral.ai/studio/audio/speech_to_text/offline_transcription#transcription): ≈15 minutes for [Voxtral Mini Transcribe](https://docs.mistral.ai/models/voxtral-mini-transcribe-25-07) and [Voxtral Small](https://docs.mistral.ai/models/voxtral-small-25-07), and ≈3 hours for [Voxtral Mini Transcribe 2](https://docs.mistral.ai/models/voxtral-mini-transcribe-26-02).

> **Tip**
>
> Here are some tips if you need to handle longer audio files:
> - **Divide the audio into smaller segments:** Transcribe each segment individually. However, be aware that this might lead to a loss of context, difficulties in splitting the audio at natural pauses (such as mid-sentence), and the need to combine the transcriptions afterward.
> - **Increase the playback speed:** Send the file at a faster pace by speeding up the audio. Keep in mind that this can reduce audio quality and require adjusting the transcription timestamps to align with the original audio file.


